Contributions to the official InfantOS project are encouraged.

By submitting code, documentation, designs, fixes, features, or other material to the official InfantOS project, **you represent that you have the necessary rights to submit that contribution.**

**You grant the InfantOS project and its copyright holder a perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, reproduce, modify, adapt, incorporate, distribute, publish, and sublicense your contribution as part of InfantOS and its future versions.**

**Contributors retain ownership of intellectual property that they independently own, except for rights specifically granted under this license or another written agreement.**

**Contributing to InfantOS does not grant the contributor ownership, control, or management rights over the InfantOS project.**

